\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Frame processing\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Use a bounded, asynchronous processing pipeline.\
The pipeline should conceptually follow:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 Camera\
  -> Frame validation\
  -> Face detection\
  -> Facial-region extraction\
  -> Frame normalization\
  -> Timestamped sample extraction\
  -> Signal buffer\
  -> Detrending and filtering\
  -> Signal-quality assessment\
  -> Heart-rate estimation\
  -> Confidence and stability checks\
  -> Results presentation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Do not run computationally expensive inference synchronously on the Flutter UI thread.\
Use isolates, native execution, or appropriate platform-specific mechanisms where supported. Verify that the chosen mechanism actually works on each target platform.\
Handle variable frame rates and irregular timestamps. Never assume that requested camera FPS equals the actual sampling rate.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

